Data.Duty:
-在授权范围内负责外汇即期及衍生品的报价、做市与交易执行，管理头寸流动性及风险敞口；
-Quote, market-make, execute FX spot and derivatives within authorized limits; manage position liquidity and risk exposures;
-研究外汇市场交易机会，开发与评估交易策略，结合市场数据和实盘结果持续优化策略表现；
-Identify FX trading opportunities; develop and evaluate trading strategies, refining performance with market data and live trading outcome;
-协助拓展业务范围：新增交易币种、完善产品体系，参与结构化产品的设计与上线；
-Support business expansion: onboard new currency pairs, enhance the product suite, and contribute to the design and launch of structured products;
-跟踪全球宏观经济、央行政策及金融市场走势，撰写市场评论、日报、月报及专题报告；
-Track global macro developments, central bank policy and financial market trends; produce market commentary, daily and monthly reports, and thematic research;
-维护并拓展交易对手方网络，就报价、流动性及执行需求保持沟通，保障日常交易顺畅开展；
-Maintain and expand the counterparty network; communicate on pricing, liquidity and execution needs to support smooth daily trading operations;
-参与交易系统、定价引擎及风控模块的规划、开发与测试，推动业务流程优化；
-Contribute to the planning, development and testing of trading, pricing and risk management systems; drive process improvements across trading workflows;
-统计并分析交易与业务数据，编制内部管理报告及对外报送材料，完成交易相关的日常运营工作。
Compile and analyze trading and business data; prepare internal management reports and external submissions; handle related day-to-day operations.

- 深入挖掘企业/机构客户在汇率风险管理、资金配置及收益增强方面的需求，提供定制化解决方案；
- Identify and assess the foreign exchange risk management, treasury allocation and yield-enhancement needs of corporate and institutional clients, and provide tailored solutions;
- 结合宏观经济、货币政策、汇率走势及市场流动性，为客户提供市场观点、产品建议及交易支持；
- Provide clients with market views, product recommendations and transaction support based on macroeconomic conditions, monetary policy, foreign exchange trends and market liquidity;
- 协调交易、产品、风险、法务、合规及运营等团队，推动业务全流程执行；
- Coordinate with trading, product, risk, legal, compliance and operations teams to facilitate the end-to-end execution of transactions and business initiatives;
- 参与外汇产品创新、业务模式建设、系统需求分析及产品测试；
- Participate in foreign exchange product innovation, business model development, system requirements analysis and product testing;
- 负责客户关系维护及其他工作。
- Maintain client relationships and undertake other relevant duties.

