- 诚信正直、低调谦逊、艰苦奋斗，过往工作中无重大失误及违法违规记录，具备良好的职业道德和专业素质；
- Upright, humble, diligent and high moral values, with a clean compliance record and strong professional ethics.
- 3~10年大型金融机构的外汇业务工作经验；
- 3–10 years of experience in foreign exchange-related business at a leading financial institution;
- 具备外汇销售、衍生品销售、结构化产品或机构客户服务经验；
- Experience in FX sales, derivatives sales, structured products or institutional client services;
- 熟悉外汇即期、远期、掉期、期权及结构性产品，具备较强的产品理解和方案设计能力；
- Familiarity with FX spot, forwards, swaps, options and structured products, with strong product knowledge and solution-design capabilities;
- 具备良好的市场分析、客户沟通、商务谈判及跨部门协调能力；
- Strong market analysis, client communication, business negotiation and cross-functional coordination skills;
- 熟练使用Bloomberg，掌握Python者优先；
- Proficiency in Bloomberg; knowledge of Python is preferred;
- 具备良好的中英文沟通能力；
- Excellent verbal and written communication skills in both Chinese and English;
- 具备较强的合规意识、责任心和团队协作精神。
- Strong compliance awareness, sense of responsibility and teamwork.
